{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-vision-toolkit#card-zh","repo":"Anionex/dsh-vision-toolkit","commit":"864968a84007e15400429bc9fb46a415500ddfc3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Vision Toolkit 为 DSH Web 与 Headless Profile 提供视觉工具和配套 Skill，让文本模型可按任务理解图片、识别长截图文字并产出视觉文件。工具覆盖图片问答与 OCR、目标定位和界面盘点、裁剪、SVG 描摹、前景提取、颜色分析、像素差异比较及本地 HTML 截图；Web 端还提供设置、粘贴图片和结果预览。适合需要在 DSH 会话中分析截图、重建界面或处理图像素材的开发者。内置视觉服务预设无需用户 API key；自定义服务使用 DSH Credential。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:80-184"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-vision-toolkit#card-en","repo":"Anionex/dsh-vision-toolkit","commit":"864968a84007e15400429bc9fb46a415500ddfc3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Vision Toolkit adds image tools to DSH: ask about images, OCR long screenshots, locate UI elements, crop or trace graphics, compare pixels, and screenshot local HTML. Web adds settings and paste support. The built-in vision service needs no user key; custom services use a DSH Credential.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:80-184"]}
